OL,3,GNEWSARoad safety warning ahead of Tour
OL,4,Aof Britain
OL,5,
OL,6,FSimon Outen-Coe, communications manager
OL,7,Fat the Lincolnshire Road Safety
OL,8,FPartnership, said the event could
OL,9,Finspire more people to take up cycling
OL,10,Fand attract riders from outside the
OL,11,Fcounty.
OL,13,F"It may well encourage more cyclists to
OL,14,Fcome into the county so we'll need to
OL,15,Fbe aware that there may be more
OL,16,Faround," he said.
